WEBVTT

00:32.741 --> 00:36.202
‎I can picture it… The Spin…

00:46.796 --> 00:48.380
‎It's spinning!

00:48.381 --> 00:49.507
‎Gyro!

00:53.511 --> 00:55.971
‎Gyro, you weren't watching?

00:55.972 --> 00:58.932
‎Why weren't you? It was amazing!

00:58.933 --> 01:01.351
‎The cork spun! I know it did!

01:01.352 --> 01:05.522
‎Why should I keep my eyes on you
‎all the time?

01:05.523 --> 01:08.234
‎So it really spun? Do it again.

01:10.153 --> 01:12.780
‎Huh? That's odd. Where'd the cork go?

01:12.781 --> 01:15.617
‎It couldn't just disappear. Where is it?

01:16.743 --> 01:17.911
‎"Pop"?

01:19.245 --> 01:22.956
‎Where'd that come from?
‎It's a little damp!

01:22.957 --> 01:25.668
‎Don't tell me… the horse's butt…

01:29.214 --> 01:32.342
‎Gyro's bag… What's that?

01:33.176 --> 01:37.095
‎That's a document case
‎with a coat of arms.

01:37.096 --> 01:38.306
‎Did he steal it?

01:39.015 --> 01:44.353
‎In Europe, you need a lord's permission
‎to have a coat of arms.

01:44.354 --> 01:48.817
‎"A boy sentenced to death"?
‎I think I've heard this before.

01:51.611 --> 01:53.278
‎What? "Judicial Officer Zeppeli"?

01:53.279 --> 01:57.325
‎Is that how you were raised?
‎Snooping through other people's things?

02:18.054 --> 02:20.514
‎I wasn't snooping.

02:20.515 --> 02:22.850
‎But who are you?

02:22.851 --> 02:24.726
‎You're not from this country?

02:24.727 --> 02:27.856
‎Just stick to opening your own bags.

02:31.568 --> 02:34.237
‎By the way, someone's over there.

02:36.030 --> 02:40.117
‎What brings someone all the way out here
‎in a desert this big?

02:40.118 --> 02:44.079
‎You said this route was
‎full of weirdos, didn't you?

02:44.080 --> 02:47.791
‎I did, but Robinson was a one-off,
‎wasn't he?

02:47.792 --> 02:51.546
‎You never know.
‎You got a weapon on you, Johnny?

02:52.213 --> 02:54.006
‎Then have it ready.

02:54.007 --> 02:57.801
‎I've got a gun. But I've never fired one.

02:57.802 --> 03:00.305
‎If he gets any closer,
‎we'll drive him off!

04:32.689 --> 04:35.732
‎First to the watering hole

04:35.733 --> 04:38.193
‎were Pocoloco, Sand Man, and Diego Brando.

04:38.194 --> 04:41.823
‎It's a predictable outcome
‎for the first day of the second stage.

04:43.825 --> 04:46.785
‎Didn't some competitors
‎take another route?

04:46.786 --> 04:49.788
‎That would be Gyro Zeppeli
‎and Johnny Joestar.

04:49.789 --> 04:53.709
‎They're camped deep in the desert,
‎about 60 miles from the start.

04:53.710 --> 04:57.587
‎Robinson, who took the same route,
‎retired after sustaining an injury.

04:57.588 --> 05:00.007
‎So they're the only two on that route?

05:00.008 --> 05:02.802
‎No, sir. There are several others as well.

05:03.803 --> 05:06.179
‎Is he really going to ride all night?

05:06.180 --> 05:09.142
‎Impossible.
‎He'd only end up hurting his horse.

05:09.684 --> 05:12.477
‎The observation balloons
‎seem to have landed already.

05:12.478 --> 05:16.815
‎Looks like this route's open
‎to interference now.

05:16.816 --> 05:18.358
‎Do you think so?

05:18.359 --> 05:20.987
‎All right! Stop right there!

05:21.571 --> 05:23.530
‎Don't take another step!

05:23.531 --> 05:25.825
‎Stop, or I'll shoot!

05:27.869 --> 05:30.162
‎You! I'm talking to you!

05:30.163 --> 05:32.622
‎I said stop right there!

05:32.623 --> 05:34.375
‎You wanna get shot?

05:35.543 --> 05:37.586
‎Please don't shoot!

05:37.587 --> 05:39.338
‎I'm Andrew Boomboom!

05:39.339 --> 05:41.089
‎I'm no threat!

05:41.090 --> 05:43.800
‎I saw your campfire and came over!

05:43.801 --> 05:46.094
‎Whether you're a threat or not,

05:46.095 --> 05:48.388
‎I'll decide after you're gone.

05:48.389 --> 05:51.433
‎I'm in trouble. Big trouble!

05:51.434 --> 05:54.103
‎I got bitten!

05:54.729 --> 05:57.814
‎I squatted to take a crap,
‎then went to wipe my ass…

05:57.815 --> 06:00.358
‎It was hiding behind my crap!

06:00.359 --> 06:01.610
‎Damn it all!

06:01.611 --> 06:04.196
‎Johnny, what did he say bit him?

06:04.197 --> 06:05.864
‎He hasn't said yet.

06:05.865 --> 06:09.034
‎Hey! Why'd you get off your horse,
‎you bastard?

06:09.035 --> 06:10.702
‎I said, stay back!

06:10.703 --> 06:14.289
‎It was a venomous lizard.
‎Yellow with black stripes!

06:14.290 --> 06:17.000
‎Please. Let me use your fire!

06:17.001 --> 06:20.545
‎I need that fire to burn the wound clean!

06:20.546 --> 06:22.339
‎The wound could be fake.

06:22.340 --> 06:25.967
‎If it was yellow with black stripes,
‎that's a spotted salamander.

06:25.968 --> 06:27.762
‎If the venom spreads, you're dead.

06:29.305 --> 06:32.516
‎Tough luck. Wait for the rescue team.

06:32.517 --> 06:36.394
‎Are you kidding?
‎They're not coming out here at night!

06:36.395 --> 06:39.148
‎I'll be dead by morning.

06:39.899 --> 06:42.317
‎I need to cut the venom out with a knife,

06:42.318 --> 06:44.319
‎then burn the wound clean!

06:44.320 --> 06:47.280
‎Give me some fire!

06:47.281 --> 06:48.949
‎You'll let him die?

06:48.950 --> 06:52.410
‎Who knows? I don't trust him.

06:52.411 --> 06:53.871
‎He's a weird one.

06:54.872 --> 06:56.957
‎You're not getting any closer!

06:56.958 --> 06:59.543
‎But I'll give you a burning log.

06:59.544 --> 07:02.088
‎Start your own fire
‎and cauterize your wound.

07:03.131 --> 07:06.967
‎Thank you, thank you, thank you!

07:06.968 --> 07:09.052
‎Thank you, thank you!

07:09.053 --> 07:11.513
‎Thank you, thank you, thank you!

07:11.514 --> 07:12.932
‎Thank you!

07:28.948 --> 07:30.449
‎Hey! What are you doing?

07:30.450 --> 07:33.618
‎It's just an anesthetic.

07:33.619 --> 07:35.287
‎I'm cutting out

07:35.288 --> 07:38.415
‎the poisoned flesh.

07:38.416 --> 07:40.793
‎I need a painkiller, right?

07:42.128 --> 07:45.547
‎It's a crazy trick only I came up with.

07:45.548 --> 07:48.425
‎I always have girls choke me.

07:48.426 --> 07:50.261
‎Don't steal my idea.

07:51.762 --> 07:55.557
‎Right to the edge of blacking out!

07:55.558 --> 07:57.267
‎What is he talking about?

07:57.268 --> 07:59.687
‎No idea! What's with him?

08:17.205 --> 08:20.540
‎Oh, no! He actually cut the wound open!

08:20.541 --> 08:22.751
‎He really got bitten by the lizard!

08:22.752 --> 08:26.379
‎Shit! Of all things to see before bed…

08:26.380 --> 08:28.423
‎All right, here's your fire!

08:28.424 --> 08:31.052
‎Now get the hell out of here!

08:32.929 --> 08:34.305
‎He's not moving.

08:35.056 --> 08:38.684
‎Maybe he really went too far… Damn it.

08:39.727 --> 08:43.230
‎Hey! Wake up!
‎Sorry I was so cold to you, but…

08:43.231 --> 08:46.483
‎You can't just lie there all night.

08:46.484 --> 08:48.903
‎Get up and leave now.

08:51.197 --> 08:54.616
‎Hey. Don't tell me you're really dead.

08:54.617 --> 08:57.994
‎Gyro, his name
‎is on the list of competitors.

08:57.995 --> 09:01.499
‎Andrew Boomboom.
‎He finished tenth in the first stage.

09:11.551 --> 09:14.761
‎Wait. Ninth was Benny Boomboom.

09:14.762 --> 09:17.973
‎Eleventh was Laurence Boomboom…
‎Same last name.

09:17.974 --> 09:20.393
‎There are three of them… A family?

09:30.361 --> 09:33.363
‎Do you think Andrew's dead?

09:33.364 --> 09:36.116
‎Dad! Is Andrew really dead?

09:36.117 --> 09:39.452
‎Shut up, you moron! Men don't cry!

09:39.453 --> 09:41.204
‎Never mind that. Gyro Zeppeli…

09:41.205 --> 09:45.167
‎He touched Andrew's bloodstained knife!

09:51.299 --> 09:53.174
‎Two riders are coming this way!

09:53.175 --> 09:55.051
‎They're a team of three.

09:55.052 --> 09:57.263
‎If they keep coming at us…

09:58.848 --> 10:01.808
‎Johnny! Shoot the one on the right!

10:01.809 --> 10:03.102
‎I'll take the left!

10:05.396 --> 10:08.189
‎What? What's this? My foot…

10:08.190 --> 10:10.066
‎Gyro! What the hell is…

10:10.067 --> 10:14.487
‎No idea! The skin on my left leg
‎is as hard as steel.

10:14.488 --> 10:17.365
‎It feels like
‎there's something solid inside it!

10:17.366 --> 10:20.243
‎Was it Andrew Boomboom?

10:20.244 --> 10:23.580
‎Or was it those two coming this way?

10:23.581 --> 10:26.124
‎It's got to be one or the other!

10:26.125 --> 10:28.418
‎But I don't know what they did to me!

10:28.419 --> 10:30.337
‎Something's wrong with my body!

10:30.338 --> 10:34.091
‎Did they poison me
‎or infect me with some disease?

10:35.426 --> 10:37.510
‎Here they come! Just take the right!

10:37.511 --> 10:39.722
‎Don't let them get any closer!

10:43.434 --> 10:44.435
‎What?

10:45.936 --> 10:46.979
‎Gyro!

10:52.193 --> 10:53.735
‎Johnny! What are you doing?

10:53.736 --> 10:56.529
‎My gun suddenly fell apart!

10:56.530 --> 10:58.949
‎It's not even old!

11:00.785 --> 11:02.994
‎Something's pulling my gun.

11:02.995 --> 11:04.872
‎Toward you!

11:10.711 --> 11:12.505
‎What the…

11:17.426 --> 11:21.180
‎Gyro! The knife's moving toward you too!

11:33.234 --> 11:35.902
‎Andrew's not moving.

11:35.903 --> 11:38.655
‎I hope he got the lizard poison out.

11:38.656 --> 11:42.534
‎Hey, Laurence.
‎Why're you still glued to my ass?

11:42.535 --> 11:45.870
‎I told you to circle around behind them.

11:45.871 --> 11:47.914
‎Our plan's simple.

11:47.915 --> 11:51.084
‎Trap them between us, and that's it!

11:51.085 --> 11:54.587
‎You're so damn slow.
‎Just like your mother.

11:54.588 --> 11:57.090
‎Isn't our mom a stork?

11:57.091 --> 11:59.801
‎Andrew said so. Do I look like a stork?

11:59.802 --> 12:02.762
‎Enough! Get around to the other side!

12:02.763 --> 12:04.639
‎Okay.

12:04.640 --> 12:07.142
‎Gyro, that knife is made of iron.

12:07.143 --> 12:09.936
‎The gun parts going into you are iron too.

12:09.937 --> 12:12.565
‎Isn't the iron being pulled toward you?

12:13.774 --> 12:15.733
‎Your blood has iron in it too.

12:15.734 --> 12:19.113
‎Maybe they're controlling iron somehow!

12:55.065 --> 12:58.152
‎The Steel Ball was shaved away in midair!

13:01.405 --> 13:05.575
‎Dad's in first. Andrew's in second.
‎And I'm in third.

13:05.576 --> 13:09.412
‎That's a lot of prize money!
‎Together, that's a fortune!

13:09.413 --> 13:11.873
‎Well, how much is that altogether?

13:11.874 --> 13:14.751
‎51.5 million dollars, you moron!

13:14.752 --> 13:17.462
‎Gyro! The Steel Balls
‎are made of iron too!

13:17.463 --> 13:19.756
‎But what could shave iron down like that?

13:19.757 --> 13:21.592
‎Who the hell are these guys?

13:22.218 --> 13:25.803
‎We're surrounded, Gyro!
‎They're circling us!

13:25.804 --> 13:27.847
‎These men are different.

13:27.848 --> 13:31.601
‎They're in a completely different league
‎from Robinson.

13:31.602 --> 13:36.064
‎They entered this race
‎with something beyond human ability!

13:36.065 --> 13:38.900
‎What do you mean?
‎What's "beyond human ability"?

13:38.901 --> 13:42.654
‎I don't know.
‎That's just the feeling I get.

13:42.655 --> 13:44.532
‎Nothing else makes sense.

13:48.536 --> 13:52.414
‎Gyro! That crazy bastard's awake!

14:02.049 --> 14:03.509
‎Gh… Ghgh…

14:04.301 --> 14:07.428
‎Andrew! You're awake!

14:07.429 --> 14:08.763
‎Is the venom gone?

14:08.764 --> 14:10.181
‎Shut up!

14:10.182 --> 14:12.308
‎Johnny! Did you see that? What was that?

14:12.309 --> 14:13.352
‎Huh? What?

14:14.436 --> 14:15.895
‎It's gone.

14:15.896 --> 14:18.064
‎Never mind that! Gyro, your leg!

14:18.065 --> 14:22.527
‎I know. It's gotten worse
‎since they surrounded us.

14:22.528 --> 14:24.487
‎This is a coordinated attack.

14:24.488 --> 14:27.407
‎The closer they get,

14:27.408 --> 14:30.578
‎the more strongly
‎the iron in me affects my body.

14:31.203 --> 14:33.371
‎If they get any closer,

14:33.372 --> 14:35.833
‎it may pierce right through me.

14:36.667 --> 14:39.252
‎Johnny, are you okay?

14:39.253 --> 14:41.087
‎Yeah, I'm fine.

14:41.088 --> 14:43.299
‎Maybe touching it did it.

14:43.966 --> 14:47.343
‎You touched his bloodstained knife.

14:47.344 --> 14:49.178
‎Hey, Laurence.

14:49.179 --> 14:51.473
‎-Yeah?
‎-Can you do this?

14:53.350 --> 14:56.853
‎Squashed nostrils!

14:56.854 --> 14:58.730
‎Whoa! That's awesome!

14:58.731 --> 15:01.566
‎You're amazing, Andrew! How'd you do that?

15:01.567 --> 15:03.818
‎No way, you moron! I'm not telling.

15:03.819 --> 15:06.738
‎You couldn't do it in a million years.

15:06.739 --> 15:10.241
‎Come on! Tell me! Tell me!

15:10.242 --> 15:13.579
‎Please, Andrew! What's the harm?

15:14.413 --> 15:16.497
‎My ears fit into my ear holes!

15:16.498 --> 15:17.665
‎They're all squashed!

15:17.666 --> 15:19.375
‎Whoa! Amazing!

15:19.376 --> 15:20.710
‎Hey! You two!

15:20.711 --> 15:23.671
‎Who's going in to finish them off?

15:23.672 --> 15:24.840
‎Do I have to?

15:25.382 --> 15:28.968
‎The guy on horseback…
‎He might have more guns.

15:28.969 --> 15:32.847
‎He doesn't. And even if he did, so what?

15:32.848 --> 15:34.557
‎I guess you're right.

15:34.558 --> 15:36.517
‎Then I'll go, Dad.

15:36.518 --> 15:39.103
‎They didn't give me the fire right away.

15:39.104 --> 15:42.815
‎I was this close to the venom spreading
‎through my whole body.

15:42.816 --> 15:45.319
‎I'm gonna make them pay!

15:50.824 --> 15:55.036
‎Hey, look. He pulled out
‎another steel ball.

15:55.037 --> 15:56.204
‎Gyro…

15:56.205 --> 15:58.290
‎Johnny, load the gear onto the horses.

16:01.669 --> 16:05.713
‎Here we go again.
‎Does he think it'll reach Andrew?

16:05.714 --> 16:08.174
‎He'll probably throw it again.

16:08.175 --> 16:13.763
‎He has no idea
‎Andrew's the best of the Boomboom family.

16:13.764 --> 16:17.309
‎Here I come! I'll rip your guts out!

16:18.727 --> 16:20.062
‎Not a chance, idiot!

16:23.649 --> 16:25.483
‎So he changed its trajectory?

16:25.484 --> 16:27.568
‎Makes no difference.

16:27.569 --> 16:30.656
‎It'll never get anywhere near me!

16:36.829 --> 16:39.998
‎It seems their ability only affects iron.

16:39.999 --> 16:41.917
‎Stone isn't affected.

16:42.918 --> 16:46.254
‎It hurts! Dad!

16:46.255 --> 16:49.716
‎Andrew's got a hole in his gut!

16:49.717 --> 16:51.551
‎That's awful!

16:51.552 --> 16:54.387
‎It's bigger than his belly button!

16:54.388 --> 16:56.389
‎We have to get out of here.

16:56.390 --> 16:57.516
‎-Let's go, Johnny!
‎-Right!

17:02.563 --> 17:04.605
‎They're running away!

17:04.606 --> 17:06.650
‎You're not getting away, you pigs!

17:08.152 --> 17:12.655
‎Dad, they're too far away.
‎And bullets are made of lead.

17:12.656 --> 17:16.743
‎I know that! Since when
‎did you become Mr. Know-It-All?

17:16.744 --> 17:20.455
‎Don't act like you know everything
‎with that tiny brain of yours!

17:20.456 --> 17:22.832
‎Hey, Andrew!
‎Scoot over to the right a bit.

17:22.833 --> 17:23.876
‎Right!

17:37.598 --> 17:40.475
‎Damn bastards… That'll do.

17:40.476 --> 17:41.893
‎Let me see your wounds.

17:41.894 --> 17:44.771
‎-Dad, I'm gonna die.
‎-That's a pretty small hole.

17:44.772 --> 17:49.275
‎When I was younger, I fell off a cliff
‎and blew my jaw clean off.

17:49.276 --> 17:52.028
‎-Then I walked three miles home.
‎-He'll pay!

17:52.029 --> 17:54.280
‎I'll get even!

17:54.281 --> 17:58.618
‎Yeah! We'll kill those two
‎and take first place in the second stage!

17:58.619 --> 18:02.539
‎And we've got an even bigger bonus
‎waiting for us!

18:04.875 --> 18:06.918
‎But how are we gonna catch them?

18:06.919 --> 18:11.172
‎Aren't we attacking them
‎because we can't just catch them?

18:11.173 --> 18:15.218
‎There he goes…
‎Our little genius has an opinion.

18:15.219 --> 18:16.636
‎Stupid little brain.

18:16.637 --> 18:19.097
‎Who ever said we'd be chasing them?

18:19.098 --> 18:21.140
‎We'll let the one behind us

18:21.141 --> 18:24.435
‎chase Gyro Zeppeli and Johnny Joestar
‎and finish them off!

18:24.436 --> 18:25.728
‎What? Behind us?

18:25.729 --> 18:28.106
‎Who's the one behind us?

18:28.107 --> 18:30.942
‎The one who's been tracking me!

18:30.943 --> 18:35.571
‎Someone's been following
‎only my horseshoe prints this whole time.

18:35.572 --> 18:38.909
‎I've known it all along!

18:39.451 --> 18:42.913
‎You mean these tracks, Dad?
‎Someone was following them?

18:43.497 --> 18:47.208
‎Probably a deputy…
‎Most likely Mountain Tim!

18:47.209 --> 18:48.626
‎Mountain Tim?

18:48.627 --> 18:51.504
‎Wow! Everyone's favorite cowboy!

18:51.505 --> 18:54.340
‎He's close to the sheriff, apparently.

18:54.341 --> 18:57.760
‎It's the cowboy, Andrew! He's after us!

18:57.761 --> 18:59.929
‎That's the problem, you moron!

18:59.930 --> 19:02.557
‎We're gonna turn that to our advantage.

19:02.558 --> 19:05.435
‎With our ability to control iron!

19:06.311 --> 19:10.774
‎Do you remember when we gained this power?

19:11.692 --> 19:12.775
‎Yeah, Dad.

19:12.776 --> 19:16.237
‎That place the Native Americans shunned…

19:16.238 --> 19:20.867
‎We got this power while searching for
‎a mine at the Devil's Palm!

19:20.868 --> 19:25.454
‎They said it'd bring misfortune,
‎but it brought us fortune!

19:25.455 --> 19:28.207
‎We'll eliminate anyone
‎who stands in our way!

19:28.208 --> 19:33.130
‎This Boomboom family
‎will stay in first place!

19:41.722 --> 19:46.684
‎I was just about to resume the pursuit
‎in the morning.

19:46.685 --> 19:49.812
‎Under the laws of the U.S.
‎and the Arizona Territory,

19:49.813 --> 19:52.690
‎I have been appointed deputy sheriff.

19:52.691 --> 19:56.777
‎You're under arrest on suspicion
‎of murdering three competitors.

19:56.778 --> 19:58.822
‎Show me your hands and come out slowly.

20:00.240 --> 20:03.076
‎I'll use force if I have to.

20:05.913 --> 20:08.290
‎Turn around! Keep your hands up.

20:12.544 --> 20:15.672
‎You're the one who finished fifth?

20:25.265 --> 20:27.308
‎What are you trying to do?

20:27.309 --> 20:30.771
‎I'd like to end this pursuit here
‎and focus on the race.

20:31.813 --> 20:32.940
‎Not so fast.

20:41.073 --> 20:44.660
‎Are you coming out, or do I drag you out?

20:47.329 --> 20:50.999
‎This rope… You're mocking me…

20:53.126 --> 20:54.586
‎What? What the…

21:13.105 --> 21:16.566
‎This is…! No way, Mountain Tim!

21:17.150 --> 21:20.779
‎You're another cursed man
‎who's been to that place?

21:22.739 --> 21:25.574
‎So this is the one who's been tracking us!

21:25.575 --> 21:28.077
‎But either way, we're still the winners!

21:28.078 --> 21:30.997
‎He touched that horseshoe,

21:30.998 --> 21:34.333
‎and now he's touched me too!

21:34.334 --> 21:36.670
‎He's finished!

21:42.259 --> 21:45.554
‎That's a surprise.
‎His name must be Johnny Joestar.

21:46.305 --> 21:48.597
‎So it was him.

21:48.598 --> 21:52.351
‎The setup's complete.
‎Now we just sit back and watch!

21:52.352 --> 21:56.897
‎Once that cowboy catches up to
‎Johnny Joestar and Gyro Zeppeli,

21:56.898 --> 21:59.859
‎the three of them
‎will be pulled together by magnetism.

21:59.860 --> 22:04.156
‎Then they'll tear themselves apart
‎and spill their guts!

23:30.951 --> 23:35.956
‎Subtitle translation by:
‎Ryoko Quirke
